OL,3,GNEWSAMan to stand trial over murder of
OL,4,ABarry Furfey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year old man has been told he will
OL,7,Fstand trial next June over the murder
OL,8,Fof Lisburn man Barry Furfey.
OL,10,FFurfey was found with serious injuries
OL,11,Fin an apartment block in the
OL,12,FWardsborough Road area of Lisburn on 15
OL,13,FSeptember last year. The 42-year old
OL,14,Fwas conveyed to the Royal Victoria
OL,15,FHospital in Belfast, where he later
OL,16,Fdied.
OL,18,FJamie Laurie Spence, whose address was
OL,19,Fgiven as HMP Maghaberry, appeared at
OL,20,FBelfast Crown Court on Friday, charged
OL,21,Fwith murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
